# ===========================================
# Moneio - Environment Variables Overview
# ===========================================
#
# This project has TWO services that need environment variables:
#
# 1. Web App (apps/web)    → Copy apps/web/.env.example to apps/web/.env.local
# 2. Worker (apps/worker)  → Copy apps/worker/.env.example to apps/worker/.env
#
# Quick setup:
#   cp apps/web/.env.example apps/web/.env.local
#   cp apps/worker/.env.example apps/worker/.env
#
# ===========================================
# REQUIRED SERVICES
# ===========================================
#
# 1. SUPABASE (Database, Auth, Storage)
#    - Create project: https://supabase.com
#    - Create storage bucket named: "documents"
#    - Enable Email auth: Authentication → Providers → Email
#
# 2. UPSTASH REDIS (Background job queue)
#    - Create database: https://console.upstash.com
#    - Use the redis:// URL (NOT the REST URL)
#
# 3. OPENAI (AI features)
#    - Get API key: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
#
# 4. GOOGLE CLOUD VISION (OCR for documents)
#    - Enable Vision API: https://console.cloud.google.com
#    - Create service account with Vision API access
#
# ===========================================
# DEPLOYMENT PLATFORMS
# ===========================================
#
# Web App:
#   - Vercel (recommended): Set env vars in Project → Settings → Environment Variables
#   - Netlify: Set env vars in Site → Settings → Environment Variables
#
# Worker:
#   - Railway: Set env vars in Project → Variables tab
#   - Render: Set env vars in Service → Environment
#   - Fly.io: fly secrets set VAR_NAME=value
#
# ===========================================
